=====================================================================================================
ZONE — zone-restricted admin employee
=====================================================================================================
NOT demonstrable in the browser: the twin contains only the master admin (role_id 1, zone_id NULL).
No zone-restricted admin employee row exists -> Data DoR gap (reported, NOT hand-seeded: seeding a
fixture to make a check pass is exactly what the QA read-only rule forbids).
Covered at the CONTROLLER level against the real DB by 2 passing tests that construct a real
zone-scoped Admin (role_id != 1 + zone_id) and invoke the real ItemController:
  ✔ Zone scoped admin in the stores zone can still create              (not over-blocked)
  ✔ Out of zone store is rejected cleanly instead of writing a null module   (no 500, no null module_id)
ProductLogic::store_module_map deliberately KEEPS ZoneScope applied, so an out-of-zone store resolves
to null and the caller rejects.

